Review-only license for anonymized NeurIPS submission

This source code is provided solely for confidential peer review of the
associated anonymized NeurIPS submission. It may be used by reviewers and
area chairs to inspect, execute, and evaluate the submitted method during
the review process.

Redistribution, public posting, or use outside the review process is not
granted by this review-only package. If the paper is accepted, the authors
intend to release a de-anonymized public version with final licensing and
citation metadata.
